WEBVTT


00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.430
When will we stop living because either we think we don't have money, 

00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:07.877
or we think we don't have time. 

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.828
I'm here in Samaria in Paita, 

00:00:10.828 --> 00:00:13.281
in the interior of Bolivia, 

00:00:13.281 --> 00:00:19.239
in a beautiful place where I take this challenge here with a penny. 

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:23.044
I have no idea where I'm going to sleep, 

00:00:23.044 --> 00:00:26.116
I have no idea what I'm going to do. 

00:00:26.121 --> 00:00:28.162
And that's the beauty of everything, 

00:00:28.162 --> 00:00:28.438
bro. 
